# Datasets only. Everything else (results, figures, checkpoints, deployment
# exports, summaries, archived runs) is tracked.
#
# Excluded because these are the raw/processed data itself: regenerable via the
# download and preprocessing scripts, several GB in size, and the .npz window
# archives individually exceed GitHub's 100MB per-file limit. data/raw/ also
# holds symlinks to the other project folders, which would be broken in clones.
/data/raw/
/data/processed/*.npz
/data/synthetic/patient_*.npz

__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
